{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1579470953"}, "name":{"label":"Khang T0899"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-01T19:29:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"64.0"}, "id":{"label":"13804596395"}, "title":{"label":"Unhelpful platform"}, "content":{"label":"I am writing to formally express my dissatisfaction regarding the handling of my cancelled flight to Dubai on 1 March 2026.\n\nThe flight was cancelled by the airline, and since the reservation was made through your platform, I was advised by the airline staff to contact Booking.com directly for further assistance. I immediately reached out via the chat box and received support from a staff member named Khoa, who was helpful initially. However, he informed me that he needed to consult another team member and would get back to me. Unfortunately, despite waiting the entire day, I did not receive any follow-up response.\n\nThis morning, I contacted your call center for further assistance. After providing my booking details, I was transferred to another department to process the refund as requested. However, the call was left unanswered. I attempted to call again, but it appeared that my number was unable to get through.\n\nI have always understood Booking.com to be a reputable and trustworthy platform. However, the way my case has been handled reflects a serious lack of professionalism and communication. As of now, I have not received any clear update regarding my refund, nor has the ticket amount been processed.\n\nFrom my perspective, this situation is unacceptable. I kindly request an immediate update regarding the status of my refund and a clear timeline for resolution. I would appreciate your prompt attention to this matter.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=367003839&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
